title: "Reading Quiz — Backend"
abstract: >-
  Backend for a gamified reading-comprehension app: a corpus of Wikipedia Vital
  articles as Markdown, AI-generated quizzes, and a Cloudflare Worker content
  API. Development of this repository was assisted by Google Gemini. The
  articles were generated by "Super Intelligence" from Wikipedia's Vital
  articles, whose text is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
